Package: pulsaros-cloud
Version: 1.0.0-13
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: rclone, fuse3, zenity, curl, gnome-terminal
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Description: Cloud drives for the Pulsar OS Finder: any provider supported by rclone.
 Adds the pulsar-cloud helper, a systemd user mount unit and cloud brand icons.
 Integrates with the Finder sidebar to add, mount and remove cloud accounts
 (Google Drive, OneDrive, iCloud or any rclone backend) under ~/Cloud/<name>.
